  - m_Id: 4202892369920
    m_Localized: Undead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4783878971392
    m_Localized: "The true rock of the team \u2013 boasts an immense health pool
      and can endure a barrage of hits. However, his movements are slow, making him
      easy to outpace by faster enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4874626932736
    m_Localized: "A madman who cares little for his own safety. His life is fragile,
      but he deals devastating damage \u2013 the closer he gets to his foe, the deadlier
      he becomes. Perfect for those who gamble everything on one strike."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4945175126016
    m_Localized: A ghastly warrior who rises from the grave again and again. Thanks
      to his cursed nature, he gains two extra respawns, making him difficult to
      defeat for good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5003354316800
    m_Localized: A noble warrior with balanced stats. He is neither the strongest
      nor the fastest, but his versatility allows him to adapt to any situation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5112381054976
    m_Localized: Gifted with the power of light, he relies on his unwavering faith.
      During a dash, he gains an extra shield that nullifies damage, allowing him
      to safely break through danger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7336779849728
    m_Localized: King
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7486822686720
    m_Localized: The absolute ruler of the battlefield. He possesses enhanced stats
      across the board and access to every ability, making him the most powerful
      character. Yet his might can be challenging to master, demanding both courage
      and wisdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
